OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,FThe recovery from wildfires,
OL,7,Fparticularly in terms of the damage
OL,8,Fthey do to nature, is a difficult and
OL,9,Flong-term challenge. ITV News Science
OL,10,FCorrespondent Martin Stew reports from
OL,11,Fprevious wildfire zones in Britain
OL,13,FWords by Science Producer Rhiannon
OL,14,FHopley
OL,16,FSummer 2026 is on track to be the UK's
OL,17,Fhottest on record. High temperatures
OL,18,Fand the lack of rain have left much of
OL,19,Fthe landscape tinderbox dry.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
