CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,FIt is perhaps not surprising then that
OL,7,Fthis year has been the worst on record
OL,8,Ffor wildfires in the UK. As of August
OL,9,F16, firefighters had responded to
OL,10,F1,132 wildfires across the UK.
OL,12,FWith four months still left to go,
OL,13,Ffigures have already comfortably
OL,14,Fsurpassed last year's total of 1,017
OL,15,Fwildfires for the whole of 2025.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,FThe destruction we have seen this year
OL,7,Franges from residential areas like
OL,8,FStourbridge, where multiple people
OL,9,Flost their homes, to areas vital for
OL,10,Fnature like the Cairngorms National
OL,11,FPark.
OL,13,FThe fires have been devastating and it
OL,14,Fwill take time for the all the
OL,15,Flandscapes to recover.
OL,17,FIn August 2025, a fire at Holt Heath
OL,18,Fnear Wimborne saw around 72 acres of
OL,19,Frare habitat lost to the flames. A
OL,20,Fyear on, the landscape is still
OL,21,Fstruggling.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31104
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,F"It still looks pretty barren," said
OL,7,FEllie Egan, a National Trust
OL,8,FCountryside Manager at the site.
OL,10,F"It still looks like the surface of
OL,11,Fthe moon coming through. There are one
OL,12,For two green shoots but we're
OL,13,Fbasically just in sand now.
OL,15,F"These little bits are basically just
OL,16,Fclinging on to the topsoil leftover
OL,17,Ffrom the burn," she added.
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@_O]yD@OO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31105
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,FWatch aerial footage from 'Stunning
OL,7,FDrone', courtesy of ITV Meridian,
OL,8,Fwhich shows a massive fire spreading
OL,9,Facross heathland near Wimborne
OL,11,FThe workers at the National Park
OL,12,Fwelcomed the government's push to stop
OL,13,Fdisposable barbecues and other fire
OL,14,Frisks but warned that with rising
OL,15,Ftemperatures, these fires will become
OL,16,Fmore commonplace in summer.
OL,18,FAny landscape lost is devastating,
OL,19,Fsays Paul Attwell, the Dorset Council
OL,20,Fteam manager at the Dorset Heaths
OL,21,FPartnership for Holt Heath.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31106
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,F"It's just so sad when you think about
OL,7,Fthe rareness of heathland that it's
OL,8,Frarer than rainforest on the planet so
OL,9,Fanything we lose is just devastating,"
OL,10,Fhe said.
OL,12,FHundreds of miles away in Galloway
OL,13,FForest in Scotland, it has been 18
OL,14,Fmonths since a fire raged across the
OL,15,Fland for four days. It is beginning to
OL,16,Fshow signs of recovery - but slowly.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31107
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,F"In a superficial sense the area has
OL,7,Fgreened... but this is heather which
OL,8,Fwas really, really badly burnt in the
OL,9,Ffire and that will take many years to
OL,10,Frecover," said John Dougan, regional
OL,11,Fmanager for Forestry and Land Scotland.
OL,13,FNative rare juniper trees were
OL,14,Fespecially badly hit. "We had 4500 of
OL,15,Fthose but all but six have been
OL,16,Fkilled," he said.
OL,18,FThere are fears azure hawker
OL,19,Fdragonflies may never return to these
OL,20,Fhills. Other species are struggling
OL,21,Ftoo.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@IO]vD@WOUxD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31108
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,F"One of the species that is hardest
OL,7,Fhit is reptiles and invertebrates like
OL,8,Fadders as they will try to escape the
OL,9,Ffire by digging down deeper
OL,10,Funderground, and fire can bury deep
OL,11,Finto peat soils and burn for weeks,
OL,12,Fmonths or years," explained Ailidh
OL,13,FReid from Forestry and Land Scotland.
OL,15,FYet all hope is not lost. At Wild Ken
OL,16,FHill in Norfolk, it has been four
OL,17,Fyears since a fire swept through and
OL,18,Fburnt 33 hectares of habitat.
OL,20,FToday, life is returning to the site.
OL,26,@nD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31109
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,FAdrian Waddison works at Wild Ken
OL,7,FHill. He said the habitat has proved
OL,8,Fits resilience.
OL,10,FHe said: "The habitat has recovered
OL,11,Freally well. In just four years, the
OL,12,Freed beds came back and we're starting
OL,13,Fto develop a scrubby area. So, we lost
OL,14,Fa lot of wildlife but as the habitat
OL,15,Freturns so does the wildlife.
OL,17,F"Like the turtle doves - we lost
OL,18,Fseveral of their breeding grounds in
OL,19,Fthe fire but now we can hear them in
OL,20,Fthe air again."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31110
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F311A1787042885
OL,3,CThe cost of the UK's wildfire summer
OL,4,Cand how it could take years to recover
OL,6,FThe National Fire Chiefs Council said
OL,7,Fthe risk of fire is growing faster
OL,8,Fthan the capacity to respond. Mr
OL,9,FWaddison agreed.
OL,11,F"The warming climate and the drier
OL,12,Fsummers means this is going to happen
OL,13,Fregularly and people just need to be
OL,14,Fvigilant. The ground is a tinderbox,"
OL,15,Fhe added.
